part of why it became the success that it became&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:34.080
season one episode seven after we ended that&nbsp;
season we did a Kickstarter and we were looking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:41.440
for thirty thousand dollars to make the&nbsp;
last I believe four or five episodes and

